dialog.open.heic_needs_safe_decoder = Sɛ wobɛbue “{name}” a, ɛhia libheif {minimum} anaa version a ɛyɛ foforo sen ɛno a HEVC decoder ka ho. Wɔasi version dedaw anaa nea wontumi nsi no pi kwan de abɔ wo ho ban afi ahobammɔ mmerɛwyɛ a wonim ho. Twe HEIC mmoa a wɔayɛ no foforo na toa so.
